# This plugin's dist/ is the artifact the image bakes (the Dockerfile does a
# plain `COPY plugins/lightbulb-marketplace` — no npm install, no build step in the
# image, same as plugins/aws-exec-profile). Override the repo-root `dist/`
# ignore so it is tracked.
#
# REBUILD AFTER EDITING src/: `npm install && npm run build && npm test`, then
# commit the regenerated dist/. CI has no step that rebuilds it for you, so a
# src/ change without a matching dist/ change ships the OLD tool.
!dist/
!dist/**

# Build-time only (the `openclaw` devDependency is ~460MB of plugin-SDK types).
# Nothing here reaches the image: typebox resolves from the host at /app.
node_modules/
